{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1340,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94297069ceaca705eae2701c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，今天是推出新色的日子！\r\n等训练结束后，\r\n就去趟美甲店吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "90d2f740121d81b659d647c110e6ecd0db9cf092e92a4600118e3522227e3f64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd7c43a7504afd858cc1c1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就开始吧。\r\n至少会完成你交代的事，\r\n你就好好看着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfc41246f4ff635d2608acc8d67cb5698235fc0af07aedab1599b3ee75cf116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb7cf67d92e81edffb840c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，要开始了吗？\r\n我的指甲也很完美，\r\n做好万全准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9899a053a933af5e3fe18d29e0ffc6d939c3f398d434731b6b07a485d48261cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee60fab9acd278ec69109840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起训练\r\n算是挺开心的。\r\n……好了，快点开始啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99f3b36c0067e9ec91912b636a09e89893cd8c2c27733d80eb5a3262b73ef31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6397b8ac29e4ff867b69111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对训练没有什么不安。\r\n毕竟你是专业的吧？这就是\r\n所谓的那个嘛，信赖？之类的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9b34bfd3285748ce1c85c595455c10426f7ed8b0d8444018d3cba25283683b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b021ac43a714495cbf4655dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是用我的照片设成手机的\r\n待机画面，就能超有干劲……\r\n不，别当真啦，我开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f12d87d8100fec06799e3e18903e22940f48f5d64921a306b4fec512b11242a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:640e113457bed27338c94eb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎能靠夏季集训\r\n好好锻练……唔，糟糕！\r\n应该没有忘记带防晒吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a9efabd82d60f3ea743a264bb17fa27ce87ed6a85e34168c216768c880b398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ece328b46ad56ac62600ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点训练吧～对了，我今天\r\n要吃圣代，所以严格一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1abd5cbc198051ebfcdb3172b8b18fbd99ad7078fa7406b2ee6ec8b8261cc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f202b169382264240d5b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿啰哈♪这套穿搭我真心超爱！\r\n会有加速效果哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3fcb82da672d422a2b2dcabff14c46332b92893fd21985994317e6553bd1430",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03ce68afd6f7fc5a0e1cfeef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然还是厚底鞋最强了吧～！\r\n战斗力都暴增啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e72b1ba56c5225996cfae62d59425c9bc63b0c564c206ac8da8627f0fc60a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc6cabdaff23fc0b2e400dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "城市最近超认真的耶……\r\n啊──！我也来训练吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da128ed30a70b89b59db5b208a28130e35489adc560753ef1801b28aa07d934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a90186cbce148c0b4c60b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是说既然要喝珍奶，\r\n还是认真训练后比较好喝嘛～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f315df9468352d55c9772f5bcc25ead290ef7de4b289b50d464b171ab20da8da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7d79af1c61849ba20ef46a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天搞不好会很嗨哦～？\r\n毕竟我打扮得超漂亮……\r\n你的训练项目也挺OK的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeff671d6a2c9011b6c04e49396bcd859c2c44ee3b99f33bddd3dc1f5f8bb38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46f0707719153c285abb6b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会认真训练的，\r\n带我去车站前那家怀旧甜点店吧？\r\n拜托啦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8718c4219e5f58c5215ba6562a8bf9778f4d68492871d1ac18083ffca595b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca94b389ca06fd4e1f1cac30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能看中你当训练员，\r\n不觉得我很有眼光吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "798bf37780c7910729867feda24aa5131e82fb698e7dcde201153e8f12dda13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb5bd10f44df22ef2f29bb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就说我也可以办得到吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c990eba76b89c631249cfe29a824da632a75d6607d29d5f9b449de60879ab30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fda213bc0427fcd401daad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和你在一起，\r\n感觉好像去哪都会很爆笑耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e2779fda194ef25421e174be5d0bfc7c00fed69ab91fe3998c7021283929a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a523e77d81528075b9db5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次你想去哪里，\r\n我可以陪你去喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b33ef2621bca107f38ee17412b873f3171891e70d55dc8bf3fc7b86f33a4723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52949b77082f5e263a882518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欧耶──感觉不错呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8d369a20eec4787982a2f065c006d8b4e1930544dfa77944d6bd8370fb53af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1257bdacf4cf2a3db2831858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的会让人嗨起来呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "555b390bd67e19892532b555ac15132978d6959555d9dba5ba123e26524d5992",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5395efb36d4ce86b726280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是东瀛佐敦，多指教咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "65fe9026897ab4bb2ad73fe9e53f05cbc2344011452b16ea8938ddd7aa6bba44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd56ccfa88f0704e49333249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，会让你见识到\r\n我也是有点实力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e08b7b41a638fab3607b6cd37f7b0419070b8886d7986ec346e3e5bda7fea8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf1ce79d3ef43119dfdd18f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还顺便擦了指甲油呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3510e6d4997777b48c4b2bfa95c431435c307f660f9deeb91ae4503d7246423b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2bab8b6039ead9f8b7bf7da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不是太强啦？笑死。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea879c7b7323abcc6841d3daf5c7f84eace09fc9615c9ab218b849f4e40b867e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a526102604c7fc9fb60e248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用力嗨起来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a714bab0235145fca637d75ddeb68cee2326892534e53f450dc99b24845eeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ed46f2e2b9a93347340abb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆嗨MAX突破破～\r\n我还会继续成长喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "420ca0aa1ca745834c11de1253e19bafe22c87030a7b8afa716c06fad0d9beac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2e7a1cc3708745c6061f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔耶，度假啰☆我们这些姐妹淘\r\n比盛夏的天气还火热吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "252ba21b557434f8074004ed0ee762d13ed37560c4ecaf4a01633a4ccda7431b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc12de7d97e050e6036860d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是东瀛佐敦──\r\n阿啰哈～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65a772f3844b4f9380c7d28671e9bb9b7fff03e6bded04ad3d2b6a97eeb89ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1048",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3723ea9dacd4a1baaa5ae0df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97749ddb19142b8bbccc7be8a5cbeabc55fb347d260493017679b91da43abbe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73ee7ebc372340887e03193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还记得那天吗——我们一起干掉那群\r\n最棒也最糟的笨蛋的那天。\r\n…自那之后，我们的故事才真正开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62c87ab285b3b08e9d9dcebacc4e12c62612f1da0902f426af0a666f1a8f0d9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42f41ff890ec85fc8a2303b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f06e9d5d4b590fa75db11b1c2431f76a413069b4adaae557632a142ae95ad45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883b392f3d1834f2a222ac53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16631fc6a4d89079e1413ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是你在我心中重新点燃了火焰，让我\r\n将生命燃尽一般地活下去、活下去…\r\n既然如此，就狂奔到身死之日吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "212601ec99e4332b45cc70985a3ed0f91649817f35b7001261398c227127726f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7101ba129319e0ee96a88451",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在算是更加堕落了呢，还是略有\r\n起色了呢。反正不管怎么说……你也\r\n已经身处“这边”了。祝你好运吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b7cb6600eacbbb34d6adf16127a7c4e94d97b1fb01ed137bb3e782bdea2056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711a1ab5e65c2dc105f4fc47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年出游呢。要是有能让我寒毛卓竖\r\n的对手在的话倒是无所谓……\r\n你可做好觉悟了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c397d7a5a28fc39253714529f81daabea87ca92076dc96110c7dd31eb12afa88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4753aaaec8566558b47fb9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你准备了有趣的巧克力哦。你会\r\n尝到『中奖』的味道还是『没中』的\r\n味道呢…来啊，你该不会想逃了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "579eabfb02afa4f5565e702d888155b5b4b2fc774e87922d6f36643dde93b975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc431e0684b15a94735f207f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不喜欢甜兮兮的点心，帮我准备点\r\n苦味的吧。这份苦涩亦是精神的食粮\r\n……也就是，人生的味道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcc62796037cdca5bb5abd4ae0d241eb3c31b1cc273b79c65ec85d3ee0a0957",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307583e7bf510e0b2e086777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "织女与牛郎的故事虽是悲剧没错……\r\n不过我对这种老老实实地遵守\r\n无趣规则的故事还是喜欢不起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9de2979a103b419b4f3cb0531b48e08bcca446e08db61844fdcb32baa64015",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9423c7f82267648c547cdf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对付恶作剧的对策已经万全。\r\n柿种花生、鱿鱼干、醋乌贼……\r\n有了这些，我可谓坚如磐石啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "198d5303e8fa4fd122fafe059ffee59cf5e9890c740a298060e35789e3387156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a22290f763eb5f3e32e429a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那帮小鬼的礼物已经寄回去了……\r\n只要假扮圣诞老人的老爹\r\n别露馅就行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7665f8df741af0d10021b22f4fa32e36f2c08f13d69edebb411cada095acbe7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1619d1d61185069baf13aa4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪儿都在庆祝圣诞节，热闹得很啊。\r\n真没办法啊……\r\n去找个安静的藏身之地吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b472808d5a88398be75d9725cce856e21e5d43092b4e39c7a21dc36cd885062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba14220f33b55c8299d89da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场让人热血沸腾的决斗啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72835c45b41dcb61bb12a2d1f267f27b5f81083a6c25ae054ba0f76b6520cb11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0e51a20992694ca1841ad2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一年过得挺快啊……也不赖吧。\r\n只有这样，才能把每一天都过得\r\n稍微刺激一些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76c117f66787940cbd373c37883be1d96e0878ba09922ab4b14d52a302d26ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:032f48b5141e1977d4577152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，你今天过生日对吧。\r\n来想个能让你尽情感到“我还活着”\r\n的刺激赌局吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b3bafe381d7452d4c6ca0760f8e4ce0026da30403801e7c4ac4e006a7a8071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b43edd63e1d7a70549b32787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闯过无数个如冰冷的火焰般的\r\n生死关头才终于迎来这一天啊……\r\n不管怎么说，先祝你生日快乐吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ebf2538a7e062ee306e50d4498b91a31b04be3fefe0d9a68fea97ff16b001b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:007f52fa853a51d913be2cf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家的那群小鬼每年都比我还兴奋。\r\n至少让我悠哉地度过自己的生日吧\r\n……真是的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e1ba4b40f501b971239796efc2e158afd7435b06595b1c58d4e5be221b176f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd1b0280fcaaff28fe4f239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然庆祝生日一般不吃那玩意儿……\r\n但我知道有家店的牛肚煮做得很棒。\r\n待会儿请我吃一碗如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "438e774d8cd7c9300e9d69cec7c026652123b7d2447383e5e0da43420fe3e46c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75186a8756d526cb586235c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有给你的通知哦。\r\n不去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "660a873cdbb9c8e0a76d44295c1db1414a6ef329a6b7474123b42bb17dbcc2fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da63be77d84498030aa87e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有送给你的礼物啊。\r\n……去瞧瞧里面是什么罢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42603d8fc8548331c000b111a29ef199f1a13a2effee675b2a1a996d8d8a9c7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:759d21c14331b1eee8f82a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成吗……亲手赢来的奖品\r\n还是快点拿走比较好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab7856a52d2cd5b02608dc41a83890c234b8df21ac47caa00a79d3dd94896e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e627a4f597832fe410b8bc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像活动快开始了。\r\n那么……你也想去掺一脚吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7711510f25327e3ae0d232cee80050e6e3f4b63144ed519f048ec5c845aea76a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ac2ce79fec93f3dd8d1536b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正在举办活动啊。\r\n……事情的进展都在你意料之中吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12d6f938ddf5751bf4e60cbf6f9e8116676d3466a251fc99127d217e69ef7af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4943860922d96636e87552ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与胜利失之交臂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5a3ce3c949a6e56c1515b55f94576115073f24cb411eebe8df7d761faf0e23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7334daa49cf4c099b89793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴的等级好像上升了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f4710cceadbae9e2e47839bbceee1fb52fb9c73dff4edb8e37f447d22a12e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf52a2e0f1c55233675cb8ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一緒にそれなりの修羅場を\r\n乗り越えてきた服だ。少しばかり\r\nくたびれ気味かもしれねえな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9880481146927bf561ccac6388ad3834edf39c29ed42f0addcd052847652a38f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81e676a857bfab6ddfe809b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好で、いろんな“遊び”を\r\nしてきた。賛辞に罵声に敵意に…\r\n染みついてるもんもいろいろだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0e623e0befbb795aea2291fc122ae892c7688815a6535f1a2e33297252124d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8f1d66cc60547ab3fd6f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…服にネコの毛がついてるな。\r\nアイツら、1度懐くと\r\nまるで遠慮がねえんだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "069b34d23c80b2644b993bf8a963923a6775db26165e84302306361c27cc6a74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b80f75ca55050ebc402d5c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和局……吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c1126c1d13078bb710678d2f36eabc6db63aa1b32ad6178248339026edb25f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae969dcf5f777cd8cca8e8a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是最棒的成果啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4975c3f29557832c986851af53ba5abed3403c8f540ebccc7476e5ca2c6ffc65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f42fb9e4d249b4ae399a144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与胜利失之交臂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5a3ce3c949a6e56c1515b55f94576115073f24cb411eebe8df7d761faf0e23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15aa258b9c4ef61a74573176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和局……吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9c1126c1d13078bb710678d2f36eabc6db63aa1b32ad6178248339026edb25f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf982270d00c0a4569dfd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向全新的领域了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff361f2521b4a71fab0c4e0ab45f5e122e72ca0509b89bfc724183fdcba26e6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8fcc5b656a881e3ab9f9aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人寒毛卓竖的时间开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94aecec8a0a078ab8c0f5a8bbcc4f9e9f952641d53993f2123894fb50ec49282",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65d480ef101d03b456e16c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2709448458e73ff6b70cb7b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗。\r\n一想到这是为真正的对决做准备，\r\n心跳就停不下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5574c6f1e906145787b00dad79fa7d95e6d2a6dba9e1663891e042ccd82ed3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec32ddba33a393bc36fa52e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔回首一下过去也不错啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c30be6df09f8a102a890087a3b05b29f52edd8cda1ab02ba01ba3822327bd144",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ceee06af1d2b6b6b188363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比赛吗？行啊。\r\n是时候往心里添把柴火了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b2359b76add8c1c67eceae1fdd4c6df9c17a82d9d840abef5e5b83e20daaba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e41a7c8d86a27a5cb881a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来一决胜负吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9253cc16c657e7458817a6d9653565ba1f08e9a7250ecc2dae212e253e96b6b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da2c08b5a8d60126e077a7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场比个输赢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a0a9185a3ff09c636756e389f9b7ec512770e6605c9af035c67f2ec03337fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce64bfdc890d9c24995d9938",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "算我一份。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc855a34a0b0769052cb540164b8479ee096fcfd8430274ef86d99686e4b7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c95c947f8f40be4434ca17e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a82f17f32130fdc2991cc9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热血沸腾……\r\n我的灵魂正在狂喜欢呼啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfcd3c82cc2b77a26289400262edd4ffa8c8bfb80335d381c4c210faba851922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdeb6db0d45558cc5b3d25f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒリつくねぇ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f18e67e52d5ec35a725cf3241c2d67f07eb32681c38e215f0e81e7c3756ac04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ed79db432eaeca8733f0bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f92f4765fa15cc14f08e74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可要好好享受一番啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "390c8ccffd6f616e09215f630a748530483f4a3e8ebf955c58bf9124771dfafa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b57af7a5ecad85f04a5234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不赖啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b9ab5b12f8adb5bd179042e899fa70b3417cff8dba86347558036a141720234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8308362637a8e5b14862fa5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让它跑掉了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09f2df07b515a7f345884baa06a5d51c74210f0ea3eacc26b3ec0aedf6e3289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feac3d010ef2f738b79f6f8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可真是让人吃惊啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ff1af5e84416864ce735ccce3498b1d6711587a525f5886765f8b3384b49b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33914af4bdf929b1ea3255aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿下这局游戏了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3901d246e4f2e114b3ddc9968a45df7feeb637dc1ce159b4591d0e1841beac6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5808a48d4488cddf0d68e676",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛……偶尔也是会有这种日子啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d66d74ad7c79d96b0a1b3e3a9eb4423e0204817514ff4da9a73136c9ff1dfa77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "140005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
